    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s just hard to \"inject intention\" into something when there's nothing there to touch. i feel like a ghost in my own life. i see my partner laughing or i'm sitting in a meeting and i'm just... watching it happen from a mile away. it's not even that it hurts, it's just that the nothingness is so heavy. i feel like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does. it's just constant, quiet emptiness.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
