      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried that stuff. music, walks, whatever. nothing works. it's like there's a wall between me and reality that i can't climb over. it just feels like a loop of nothingness that never ends. i keep thinking... what if this is just it? what if this emptiness is the only thing that's actually real? it's so tiring to keep pretending i'm actually \"here\" when i'm not.",
